REPLACE THIS FILE WITH: theme_frame.png
- Role   : Background behind the tab strip (active window)
- Size   : 2500 × 200 px  (Chrome tiles it horizontally if narrower)
- Format : PNG-24 (transparency supported)
- Tips   : The top ~135 px are visible above the toolbar.
           Place your logo/pattern in the right half so it shows
           even on smaller screens once tabs fill the left.
